msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/annotationBodyFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "annotationBody is functional"
msgstr "annotationBody 具有函数性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/annotationBodyFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:annotationBody is functional: an annotation attaches exactly one note as its body, the single piece of content being attached — a highlight or bookmark simply has none. This record is not a definition of that term and never a shape: the obligation is reasoned from the record, not restated elsewhere."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:annotationBody 是函数性的:一条注释恰好附加一条笔记作为其正文,即被附加的单一内容——而高亮或书签则根本没有正文。该记录不是该术语的定义，也绝不是形状：义务由该记录推理得出，而非在别处重述。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/annotationMotivationFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "annotationMotivation is functional"
msgstr "annotationMotivation 具有函数性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/annotationMotivationFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:annotationMotivation is functional: an annotation carries exactly one motivation, the single purpose for which its body is attached to its target. This record is not a definition of that term and never a shape: the obligation is reasoned from the record, not restated elsewhere."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:annotationMotivation 是函数性的:一条注释恰好携带一个动机,即其正文被附加到其目标的唯一目的。该记录不是该术语的定义，也绝不是形状：义务由该记录推理得出，而非在别处重述。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/annotationTargetFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "annotationTarget is functional"
msgstr "annotationTarget 具有函数性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/annotationTargetFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:annotationTarget is functional: an annotation binds exactly one target, the single entity being annotated. This record is not a definition of that term and never a shape: the obligation is reasoned from the record, not restated elsewhere."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:annotationTarget 是函数性的:一条注释恰好绑定一个目标,即被注释的单一实体。该记录不是该术语的定义，也绝不是形状：义务由该记录推理得出，而非在别处重述。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/annotationBodyFunctionality|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when the native coherence gate must enforce that gmeow:annotationBody names exactly one value; this record is the canonical carrier the gate joins, so the obligation is reasoned rather than restated on a shape surface."
msgstr "当原生一致性门必须强制 gmeow:annotationBody 恰好命名一个值 时使用；该记录是门所连接的规范载体，因此该义务是被推理出来的，而非在形状表面上重述。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/annotationBodyFunctionality|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid this record when a second value would make the record ambiguous — retire the assertion instead of weakening it, and never mirror it as a hand-authored shape."
msgstr "当第二个值会使该记录产生歧义时避免使用该记录——应撤回该断言而非削弱它，且绝不将其复刻为手写形状。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/annotationBodyFunctionality|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Read together with logic:characteristicSort: the pair (logic:characterizes gmeow:annotationBody, logic:characteristicSort logic:functionalProperty) is the whole obligation, and the OWL grounding view projects the matching characteristic from it."
msgstr "与 logic:characteristicSort 一并阅读：(logic:characterizes gmeow:annotationBody, logic:characteristicSort logic:functionalProperty) 这一对构成完整义务，OWL 基础视图据此投影出相应特征。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/annotationBodyFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "gmeow:annotationBodyFunctionality logic:characterizes gmeow:annotationBody ."
msgstr "gmeow:annotationBodyFunctionality logic:characterizes gmeow:annotationBody ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/annotationMotivationFunctionality|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when the native coherence gate must enforce that gmeow:annotationMotivation names exactly one value; this record is the canonical carrier the gate joins, so the obligation is reasoned rather than restated on a shape surface."
msgstr "当原生一致性门必须强制 gmeow:annotationMotivation 恰好命名一个值 时使用；该记录是门所连接的规范载体，因此该义务是被推理出来的，而非在形状表面上重述。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/annotationMotivationFunctionality|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid this record when a second value would make the record ambiguous — retire the assertion instead of weakening it, and never mirror it as a hand-authored shape."
msgstr "当第二个值会使该记录产生歧义时避免使用该记录——应撤回该断言而非削弱它，且绝不将其复刻为手写形状。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/annotationMotivationFunctionality|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Read together with logic:characteristicSort: the pair (logic:characterizes gmeow:annotationMotivation, logic:characteristicSort logic:functionalProperty) is the whole obligation, and the OWL grounding view projects the matching characteristic from it."
msgstr "与 logic:characteristicSort 一并阅读：(logic:characterizes gmeow:annotationMotivation, logic:characteristicSort logic:functionalProperty) 这一对构成完整义务，OWL 基础视图据此投影出相应特征。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/annotationMotivationFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "gmeow:annotationMotivationFunctionality logic:characterizes gmeow:annotationMotivation ."
msgstr "gmeow:annotationMotivationFunctionality logic:characterizes gmeow:annotationMotivation ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/annotationTargetFunctionality|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when the native coherence gate must enforce that gmeow:annotationTarget names exactly one value; this record is the canonical carrier the gate joins, so the obligation is reasoned rather than restated on a shape surface."
msgstr "当原生一致性门必须强制 gmeow:annotationTarget 恰好命名一个值 时使用；该记录是门所连接的规范载体，因此该义务是被推理出来的，而非在形状表面上重述。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/annotationTargetFunctionality|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid this record when a second value would make the record ambiguous — retire the assertion instead of weakening it, and never mirror it as a hand-authored shape."
msgstr "当第二个值会使该记录产生歧义时避免使用该记录——应撤回该断言而非削弱它，且绝不将其复刻为手写形状。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/annotationTargetFunctionality|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Read together with logic:characteristicSort: the pair (logic:characterizes gmeow:annotationTarget, logic:characteristicSort logic:functionalProperty) is the whole obligation, and the OWL grounding view projects the matching characteristic from it."
msgstr "与 logic:characteristicSort 一并阅读：(logic:characterizes gmeow:annotationTarget, logic:characteristicSort logic:functionalProperty) 这一对构成完整义务，OWL 基础视图据此投影出相应特征。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/annotationTargetFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "gmeow:annotationTargetFunctionality logic:characterizes gmeow:annotationTarget ."
msgstr "gmeow:annotationTargetFunctionality logic:characterizes gmeow:annotationTarget ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/annotationBodyFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Scope: this record carries ONE integrity obligation about gmeow:annotationBody and nothing else. It is not a definition of gmeow:annotationBody (that lives on the term itself), not a shape, and not a second place to state the term's meaning — retire the record rather than broaden it."
msgstr "范围：该记录仅承载关于 gmeow:annotationBody 的一项完整性义务，别无其他。它不是 gmeow:annotationBody 的定义（定义位于术语自身），不是形状，也不是重述该术语含义的第二处位置——应撤回该记录而非扩大其范围。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/annotationMotivationFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Scope: this record carries ONE integrity obligation about gmeow:annotationMotivation and nothing else. It is not a definition of gmeow:annotationMotivation (that lives on the term itself), not a shape, and not a second place to state the term's meaning — retire the record rather than broaden it."
msgstr "范围：该记录仅承载关于 gmeow:annotationMotivation 的一项完整性义务，别无其他。它不是 gmeow:annotationMotivation 的定义（定义位于术语自身），不是形状，也不是重述该术语含义的第二处位置——应撤回该记录而非扩大其范围。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/annotationTargetFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Scope: this record carries ONE integrity obligation about gmeow:annotationTarget and nothing else. It is not a definition of gmeow:annotationTarget (that lives on the term itself), not a shape, and not a second place to state the term's meaning — retire the record rather than broaden it."
msgstr "范围：该记录仅承载关于 gmeow:annotationTarget 的一项完整性义务，别无其他。它不是 gmeow:annotationTarget 的定义（定义位于术语自身），不是形状，也不是重述该术语含义的第二处位置——应撤回该记录而非扩大其范围。"

# Record-intake vocabulary and canonical integrity.

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/purposeAsWritten|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "purpose as written"
msgstr "用途原文"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/purposeAsWritten|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A note's purpose in exactly its writer's words when it does not resolve to a purpose tag in the relevant scheme. It specializes tagAsWritten without inventing an AnnotationMotivation or Tag."
msgstr "当笔记用途不能解析为相关方案中的用途标签时，按作者原话保留。它特化 tagAsWritten，不虚构 AnnotationMotivation 或 Tag。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/purposeAsWritten|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Untagged source text remains xsd:string. Several spellings and attributed interpretations coexist."
msgstr "未标记的来源文本仍为 xsd:string。多种拼写及带归属的解释可共存。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/purposeAsWritten|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:note gmeow:purposeAsWritten \"think this through later\"@en ."
msgstr "ex:note gmeow:purposeAsWritten \"以后再仔细思考\"@zh ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/notes|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Core notes and annotation records over shared evidence, naming and tagging foundations. Logical and kernel dependencies support this domain-independent vocabulary. This manifest declares slice identity, tier, dependencies and consumer."
msgstr "基于共享证据、命名和标签基础的核心笔记与注释记录词汇。逻辑与内核依赖支持这一独立于领域的词汇。本清单声明切片身份、层级、依赖项和使用方。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/NotebookEntry|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Notebook Entry"
msgstr "笔记本条目"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/NotebookEntry|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A working note whose notebook function and writer assessment can be recorded separately from its content."
msgstr "一种工作笔记，其笔记本功能及评估撰写者所作的评估可与内容分开记录。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/NotebookEntry|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "An entry is content, not an assertion act, a scheduler episode or a runnable step. Recording it does not assert the truth of its content."
msgstr "条目是内容，不是断言行为、调度片段或可运行步骤。记录条目并不断言其内容为真。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/NotebookEntry|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:idea a gmeow:NotebookEntry ; gmeow:noteContent \"Consider a second explanation.\"@en ."
msgstr "ex:idea a gmeow:NotebookEntry ; gmeow:noteContent \"考虑另一种解释。\"@zh ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/NotebookEntry|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use for a working note with an explicitly recorded notebook kind or writer assessment."
msgstr "用于明确记录了笔记本种类或评估撰写者所作评估的工作笔记。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/NotebookEntry|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inferring a belief, an intention or an executable plan from an entry."
msgstr "避免从条目推断信念、意图或可执行计划。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/NotebookEntry|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Reuse noteContent and noteAuthor; record kind and state separately, with the writer frame on each exact state claim."
msgstr "复用 noteContent 和 noteAuthor；分别记录种类和状态，并在每条确切的状态断言上记录该评估撰写者的框架。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/NotebookEntryKind|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Notebook Entry Kind"
msgstr "笔记本条目种类"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/NotebookEntryKind|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "An open value vocabulary for the working-note function of a notebook entry."
msgstr "一个开放的值词汇表，用于描述笔记本条目的工作笔记功能。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/NotebookEntryKind|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Kind is independent of writer assessment. The four seeds impose no allowed kind and state matrix."
msgstr "种类独立于作者评估。四个初始值不规定种类与状态的允许组合矩阵。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/NotebookEntryKind|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "gmeow:notebookHypothesis a gmeow:NotebookEntryKind ."
msgstr "gmeow:notebookHypothesis a gmeow:NotebookEntryKind ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/NotebookEntryKind|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to distinguish conjectures, inquiry branches, material in process and proposed next actions."
msgstr "用于区分猜想、探究分支、处理中的材料和提议的下一步行动。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/NotebookEntryKind|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid closing the vocabulary, inferring a state or creating a notebook subclass for each kind."
msgstr "避免封闭词汇表、推断状态或为每种种类创建条目子类。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/NotebookEntryKind|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Choose an individual through notebookEntryKind; add a labelled individual for another working-note function."
msgstr "通过 notebookEntryKind 选择个体；需要其他工作笔记功能时，添加带标签的个体。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/notebookEntryKind|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "notebook entry kind"
msgstr "笔记本条目种类"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/notebookEntryKind|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The working-note function recorded for a notebook entry."
msgstr "为笔记本条目记录的工作笔记功能。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/notebookEntryKind|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Nonfunctional and independent of state. Missing kind is unspecified; multiple attributed classifications coexist."
msgstr "非函数性关系，独立于状态。缺失种类表示未指定；多个有归属的分类可以共存。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/notebookEntryKind|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:idea gmeow:notebookEntryKind gmeow:notebookHypothesis ."
msgstr "ex:idea gmeow:notebookEntryKind gmeow:notebookHypothesis ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/notebookEntryKind|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when a source explicitly classifies the function of a working note."
msgstr "当来源明确对工作笔记的功能分类时使用。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/notebookEntryKind|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid deriving a state, truth verdict or executable capability from a kind."
msgstr "避免从种类推导状态、真值判定或可执行能力。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/notebookEntryKind|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Link the NotebookEntry to its stated NotebookEntryKind and retain attribution and context."
msgstr "将 NotebookEntry 关联到其声明的 NotebookEntryKind，并保留归属和语境。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/notebookHypothesis|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "notebook hypothesis"
msgstr "笔记本假设"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/notebookHypothesis|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The working-note function of recording a conjecture."
msgstr "记录猜想的工作笔记功能。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/notebookHypothesis|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "A conjecture entry establishes no truth, mental belief or test execution."
msgstr "猜想条目不确立真实性、心理信念或测试执行。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/notebookHypothesis|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:idea gmeow:notebookEntryKind gmeow:notebookHypothesis ."
msgstr "ex:idea gmeow:notebookEntryKind gmeow:notebookHypothesis ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/notebookHypothesis|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when the note serves to record a conjecture for consideration."
msgstr "当笔记用于记录供考虑的猜想时使用。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/notebookHypothesis|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid treating this classification as a verified proposition or an inferred belief."
msgstr "避免将此分类视为已验证的命题或推断出的信念。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/notebookHypothesis|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Set notebookEntryKind to gmeow:notebookHypothesis and retain the conjecture as note content."
msgstr "将 notebookEntryKind 设为 gmeow:notebookHypothesis，并将猜想保留为笔记内容。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/notebookBranch|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "notebook inquiry branch"
msgstr "笔记本探究分支"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/notebookBranch|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The working-note function of recording an alternative line of inquiry."
msgstr "记录另一条探究路线的工作笔记功能。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/notebookBranch|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "A line of inquiry is not automatically a software branch or an admitted executable path."
msgstr "探究路线不会自动成为软件分支或已获准的可执行路径。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/notebookBranch|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:route gmeow:notebookEntryKind gmeow:notebookBranch ."
msgstr "ex:route gmeow:notebookEntryKind gmeow:notebookBranch ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/notebookBranch|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when the note records an alternative route of inquiry."
msgstr "当笔记记录另一条探究路线时使用。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/notebookBranch|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inferring software branch identity, execution order or branch state from this kind."
msgstr "避免从此种类推断软件分支身份、执行顺序或分支状态。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/notebookBranch|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Set notebookEntryKind to gmeow:notebookBranch and retain the line of inquiry in the note."
msgstr "将 notebookEntryKind 设为 gmeow:notebookBranch，并在笔记中保留探究路线。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/notebookDataInProcess|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "notebook material in process"
msgstr "笔记本处理中材料"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/notebookDataInProcess|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The working-note function of recording material being worked on."
msgstr "记录正在处理的材料的工作笔记功能。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/notebookDataInProcess|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "This kind describes the note’s function, not a runtime processing status or proof that computation occurred."
msgstr "此种类描述笔记的功能，不表示运行时处理状态，也不证明计算已发生。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/notebookDataInProcess|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:material gmeow:notebookEntryKind gmeow:notebookDataInProcess ."
msgstr "ex:material gmeow:notebookEntryKind gmeow:notebookDataInProcess ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/notebookDataInProcess|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when the note holds material the writer is working through."
msgstr "当笔记保存作者正在梳理的材料时使用。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/notebookDataInProcess|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid using this kind as a running job status, completion receipt or admission verdict."
msgstr "避免将此种类用作运行中的作业状态、完成回执或准入判定。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/notebookDataInProcess|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Set notebookEntryKind to gmeow:notebookDataInProcess and retain the material and its source."
msgstr "将 notebookEntryKind 设为 gmeow:notebookDataInProcess，并保留材料及其来源。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/notebookNextStep|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "notebook proposed next action"
msgstr "笔记本提议的下一步行动"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/notebookNextStep|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The working-note function of recording a proposed next action."
msgstr "记录提议的下一步行动的工作笔记功能。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/notebookNextStep|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "A next-action note is not an Intention, a command, an admitted PlanStep or an executable plan."
msgstr "下一步行动笔记不是 Intention、命令、已获准的 PlanStep 或可执行计划。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/notebookNextStep|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:next gmeow:notebookEntryKind gmeow:notebookNextStep ."
msgstr "ex:next gmeow:notebookEntryKind gmeow:notebookNextStep ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/notebookNextStep|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when the note proposes what could be done next."
msgstr "当笔记提议接下来可以做什么时使用。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/notebookNextStep|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inferring commitment, authorization, scheduling or execution from the proposal."
msgstr "避免从该提议推断承诺、授权、调度或执行。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/notebookNextStep|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Set notebookEntryKind to gmeow:notebookNextStep and keep the proposed action as note content."
msgstr "将 notebookEntryKind 设为 gmeow:notebookNextStep，并将提议的行动保留为笔记内容。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/NotebookEntryState|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Notebook Entry State"
msgstr "笔记本条目状态"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/NotebookEntryState|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "An open value vocabulary for a writer’s declared assessment of a notebook entry."
msgstr "一个开放的值词汇表，用于描述评估撰写者对笔记本条目声明的评估。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/NotebookEntryState|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "States classify notebook work, not truth or mental belief. They imply no kind, allowed kind and state matrix or automatic transition."
msgstr "状态对笔记本工作分类，不表示真值或心理信念。它们不蕴含种类、种类与状态的允许组合矩阵或自动转换。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/NotebookEntryState|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "gmeow:hypothesisHeld a gmeow:NotebookEntryState ."
msgstr "gmeow:hypothesisHeld a gmeow:NotebookEntryState ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/NotebookEntryState|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use for a writer’s explicit notebook assessment, separately from entry content and kind."
msgstr "用于记录作者在笔记本中的明确评估，与条目内容和种类分开。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/NotebookEntryState|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid treating the seeds as exhaustive, selecting a global winner or inferring a default state."
msgstr "避免将初始值视为穷尽列表、选择全局优先状态或推断默认状态。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/NotebookEntryState|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Select a value through notebookEntryState and scope the exact state assertion accordingTo its writer."
msgstr "通过 notebookEntryState 选择值，并使用 accordingTo 将确切的状态断言置于其作者的框架中。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/notebookEntryState|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "notebook entry state"
msgstr "笔记本条目状态"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/notebookEntryState|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A notebook assessment declared by the writer serving as the frame of the exact state assertion."
msgstr "由评估撰写者声明的笔记本评估；该撰写者充当确切状态断言的框架。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/notebookEntryState|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Nonfunctional. Missing metadata is unspecified; conflicting and historical claims coexist without a default, winner or latest-timestamp selection. Writer framing supplies no authentication or write permission."
msgstr "非函数性关系。缺失元数据表示未指定；冲突断言与历史断言可以共存，不产生默认值、优先选择或按最新时间戳选择。作者框架不提供身份认证或写入权限。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/notebookEntryState|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:state rdf:reifies <<( ex:idea gmeow:notebookEntryState gmeow:hypothesisHeld )>> ; gmeow:accordingTo ex:writer ."
msgstr "ex:state rdf:reifies <<( ex:idea gmeow:notebookEntryState gmeow:hypothesisHeld )>> ; gmeow:accordingTo ex:writer ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/notebookEntryState|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to preserve the selected writer’s declared notebook assessment without replacing other writers’ claims."
msgstr "用于保留所选作者声明的笔记本评估，而不替换其他作者的断言。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/notebookEntryState|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid using authorship or recording attribution alone as the writer frame or permission evidence."
msgstr "避免仅凭作者身份或记录归属确定作者框架，或将其作为权限证据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/notebookEntryState|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Reify the exact entry and state tuple; use accordingTo for the writer, wasAttributedTo for the recording Agent and wasDerivedFrom for the source artifact."
msgstr "创建一个 RDF 1.2 rdf:reifies 重述节点来保留确切的条目与状态元组；使用 accordingTo 指明评估撰写者，wasAttributedTo 指明执行记录的 Agent，wasDerivedFrom 指明来源制品。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/hypothesisUnderTest|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "hypothesis under examination"
msgstr "审查中的假设"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/hypothesisUnderTest|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A writer’s declared notebook assessment of a hypothesis as under examination."
msgstr "作者在笔记本中声明某个假设正接受审查的评估。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/hypothesisUnderTest|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "The classification establishes no test execution, test result, truth or mental belief."
msgstr "此分类不确立测试执行、测试结果、真实性或心理信念。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/hypothesisUnderTest|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:state rdf:reifies <<( ex:idea gmeow:notebookEntryState gmeow:hypothesisUnderTest )>> ; gmeow:accordingTo ex:writer ."
msgstr "ex:state rdf:reifies <<( ex:idea gmeow:notebookEntryState gmeow:hypothesisUnderTest )>> ; gmeow:accordingTo ex:writer ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/hypothesisUnderTest|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when the writer explicitly marks a notebook hypothesis as under examination."
msgstr "当作者明确将笔记本假设标记为正在审查时使用。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/hypothesisUnderTest|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inferring that a test ran or treating an absent state as under examination."
msgstr "避免推断测试已运行，或将缺失状态视为正在审查。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/hypothesisUnderTest|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Record hypothesisUnderTest through notebookEntryState with the exact claim scoped accordingTo its writer."
msgstr "通过 notebookEntryState 记录 hypothesisUnderTest，并使用 accordingTo 将确切断言置于其作者的框架中。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/hypothesisHeld|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "hypothesis retained for notebook work"
msgstr "笔记本工作中保留的假设"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/hypothesisHeld|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A writer’s declared notebook assessment retaining a hypothesis as a working candidate."
msgstr "作者在笔记本中声明将某个假设保留为工作候选项的评估。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/hypothesisHeld|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Retaining a working candidate establishes neither truth nor a mental belief held by the writer."
msgstr "保留工作候选项既不确立真实性，也不确立作者持有心理信念。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/hypothesisHeld|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:state rdf:reifies <<( ex:idea gmeow:notebookEntryState gmeow:hypothesisHeld )>> ; gmeow:accordingTo ex:writer ."
msgstr "ex:state rdf:reifies <<( ex:idea gmeow:notebookEntryState gmeow:hypothesisHeld )>> ; gmeow:accordingTo ex:writer ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/hypothesisHeld|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when the writer explicitly retains a hypothesis as a working candidate in the notebook."
msgstr "当作者明确在笔记本中将假设保留为工作候选项时使用。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/hypothesisHeld|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid equating retained notebook work with verified truth, endorsement or doxastic belief."
msgstr "避免将笔记本中保留的工作等同于已验证的真实性、认可或信念。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/hypothesisHeld|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Record hypothesisHeld through notebookEntryState with the exact claim scoped accordingTo its writer."
msgstr "通过 notebookEntryState 记录 hypothesisHeld，并使用 accordingTo 将确切断言置于其作者的框架中。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/hypothesisDropped|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "hypothesis set aside in the notebook"
msgstr "笔记本中搁置的假设"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/hypothesisDropped|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A writer’s declared notebook assessment setting a hypothesis aside from working consideration."
msgstr "作者在笔记本中声明将某个假设暂置于工作考虑范围之外的评估。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/hypothesisDropped|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Setting the hypothesis aside establishes neither falsity nor deletion of its content or history."
msgstr "搁置假设既不确立其为假，也不删除其内容或历史。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/hypothesisDropped|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:state rdf:reifies <<( ex:idea gmeow:notebookEntryState gmeow:hypothesisDropped )>> ; gmeow:accordingTo ex:writer ."
msgstr "ex:state rdf:reifies <<( ex:idea gmeow:notebookEntryState gmeow:hypothesisDropped )>> ; gmeow:accordingTo ex:writer ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/hypothesisDropped|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when the writer explicitly sets a notebook hypothesis aside."
msgstr "当作者明确搁置笔记本假设时使用。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/hypothesisDropped|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inferring refutation, deleting the entry or suppressing it automatically from this state."
msgstr "避免从此状态推断反驳、删除条目或自动隐藏条目。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/hypothesisDropped|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Record hypothesisDropped through notebookEntryState while retaining the entry and previous attributed claims."
msgstr "通过 notebookEntryState 记录 hypothesisDropped，同时保留条目和此前有归属的断言。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/branchOpen|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "notebook inquiry branch open"
msgstr "笔记本探究分支开放"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/branchOpen|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A writer’s declared notebook assessment that a line of inquiry remains open."
msgstr "作者在笔记本中声明某条探究路线仍开放的评估。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/branchOpen|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "An open inquiry classification establishes no executable path, scheduled work or actual pursuit."
msgstr "开放探究分类不确立可执行路径、已调度工作或实际开展的探究。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/branchOpen|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:state rdf:reifies <<( ex:route gmeow:notebookEntryState gmeow:branchOpen )>> ; gmeow:accordingTo ex:writer ."
msgstr "ex:state rdf:reifies <<( ex:route gmeow:notebookEntryState gmeow:branchOpen )>> ; gmeow:accordingTo ex:writer ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/branchOpen|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when the writer explicitly keeps a line of inquiry open in the notebook."
msgstr "当作者明确在笔记本中保留开放的探究路线时使用。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/branchOpen|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid deriving this state from branch kind alone or treating it as execution readiness."
msgstr "避免仅从分支种类推导此状态，或将其视为已准备好执行。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/branchOpen|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Record branchOpen through notebookEntryState with the exact claim scoped accordingTo its writer."
msgstr "通过 notebookEntryState 记录 branchOpen，并使用 accordingTo 将确切断言置于其作者的框架中。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/branchClosed|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "notebook inquiry branch closed"
msgstr "笔记本探究分支关闭"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/branchClosed|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A writer’s declared notebook assessment closing a line of inquiry in the notebook."
msgstr "作者在笔记本中声明关闭某条探究路线的评估。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/branchClosed|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Closing a notebook branch establishes no goal completion, successful execution or deletion of the recorded work."
msgstr "关闭笔记本分支不确立目标完成、成功执行或已记录工作的删除。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/branchClosed|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:state rdf:reifies <<( ex:route gmeow:notebookEntryState gmeow:branchClosed )>> ; gmeow:accordingTo ex:writer ."
msgstr "ex:state rdf:reifies <<( ex:route gmeow:notebookEntryState gmeow:branchClosed )>> ; gmeow:accordingTo ex:writer ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/branchClosed|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when the writer explicitly closes a notebook line of inquiry."
msgstr "当作者明确关闭笔记本中的探究路线时使用。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/branchClosed|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid treating branch closure as a completed task, a satisfied goal or authority to discard history."
msgstr "避免将分支关闭视为任务完成、目标已满足或丢弃历史的权限。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/branchClosed|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Record branchClosed through notebookEntryState while retaining the entry and previous attributed claims."
msgstr "通过 notebookEntryState 记录 branchClosed，同时保留条目和此前有归属的断言。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/notebookStatement|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "notebook quoted statement"
msgstr "笔记簿引用陈述"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/notebookStatement|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The original native RDF 1.2 triple term retained on a NotebookEntry and shared exactly with its rdf:reifies value."
msgstr "NotebookEntry 上保留的原始原生 RDF 1.2 三元组项，与其 rdf:reifies 值完全相同。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/notebookStatement|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when the source supplies an actual quoted triple term for a valid notebook entry."
msgstr "当来源为有效笔记簿条目提供实际引用三元组项时使用。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/notebookStatement|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid string conversion, asserting the quoted proposition or inferring truth, belief or execution."
msgstr "避免转换为字符串、断言被引用命题，或推断真实性、信念或执行。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/notebookStatement|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Retain the exact same native term through notebookStatement and rdf:reifies on that entry, with actual source context."
msgstr "在同一条目上通过 notebookStatement 和 rdf:reifies 保留完全相同的原生项及实际来源上下文。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/notebookStatement|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Nonfunctional and without a declared range. Inherited Note content requirements remain; quotation does not replace them or validate arbitrary terms."
msgstr "非函数性，不声明值域。继承的 Note 内容要求仍适用；引用不能替代这些要求，也不验证任意项。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/notebookStatement|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "An entry keeps a quoted candidate statement without asserting that statement."
msgstr "条目保留引用的候选陈述，而不将该陈述断言为真。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/NotebookStatementConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Notebook statement quotation constraint"
msgstr "笔记簿陈述引用约束"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/NotebookStatementConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Each notebookStatement shares its exact same native RDF 1.2 triple term with rdf:reifies on that entry. Quotation is neither assertion nor a generic triple-term validator."
msgstr "每个 notebookStatement 与该条目上的 rdf:reifies 共享完全相同的原生 RDF 1.2 三元组项。引用既不是断言，也不是通用三元组项验证器。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/NotebookStatementConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to preserve the exact quotation binding of a supplied notebook statement."
msgstr "用于保留已提供笔记簿陈述的确切引用绑定。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/NotebookStatementConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid another entry’s quote, substitute prose or an invented witness."
msgstr "避免使用其他条目的引用、替代文字或虚构见证。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/NotebookStatementConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Keep the same bound entry and term in notebookStatement and rdf:reifies."
msgstr "在 notebookStatement 和 rdf:reifies 中保留相同绑定条目及项。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/NotebookStatementConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Native transport owns the quoted representation; inherited Note content remains required."
msgstr "原生传输负责被引用表示；继承的 Note 内容仍必须提供。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/NotebookStatementConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "A quote on a different entry cannot satisfy this entry’s exact statement binding."
msgstr "其他条目上的引用不能满足本条目的确切陈述绑定。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/NotebookStatementConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/message"
msgid "Each notebookStatement shares its exact same native RDF 1.2 triple term with rdf:reifies on that entry. Quotation is neither assertion nor a generic triple-term validator."
msgstr "每个 notebookStatement 与该条目上的 rdf:reifies 共享完全相同的原生 RDF 1.2 三元组项。引用既不是断言，也不是通用三元组项验证器。"
